# Server structure

Work in **`server/`**, not `backend/`.

```text
server/src/
  routes/         # HTTP paths → controllers
  controllers/    # parse req, call services, send res
  services/       # business logic
  middleware/     # auth, tenant, roles, errors
  validators/     # Zod schemas
  config/         # env, prisma, API_PREFIX
```

- Fat services, thin controllers. No Prisma in route files.
- Mount routers on `API_PREFIX` (`/api/v1`). Example: `/api/v1/auth/login`.
- Auth and RBAC run on the server, never only on the client.
